%SIXMD 1
# @?DU - REPORT FILE AND DIRECTORY SPACE

## DESCRIPTION

DU RECURSIVELY PRINTS THE SIZE IN 36-BIT WORDS OF EACH FILE OR DIRECTORY.
DIRECTORY TOTALS INCLUDE THE DIRECTORY OBJECT ITSELF AND ALL DESCENDANTS.
WITH NO PATH, DU STARTS AT THE CURRENT DIRECTORY.

USAGE IS 'DU [PATH ...]'.

THE WALK IS DELIBERATELY BOUNDED TO 12 DIRECTORY LEVELS, MATCHING THE
DAIMOSV1 COMMAND WHILE USING THE CURRENT VFS/WORD-STREAM INTERFACE.

## @?OPERANDS

### @?PATH
FILE OR DIRECTORY TO MEASURE.  MORE THAN ONE PATH MAY BE GIVEN.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - ALL REQUESTED PATHS WERE WALKED
### @?1 - A STAT, DIRECTORY, PATH, OR OUTPUT OPERATION FAILED

